     1632             size 8.5 by 0.63 at row 20 col 25.5
     1633        "Расход" VIEW-AS TEXT
     1634             size 8.5 by 0.63 at row 20 col 51
     1635       WITH VIEW-AS DIALOG-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER
     1636            SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D
     1637            size 100.13 by 24.88
     1638            TITLE "отчет по поставщику".
     1639   ASSIGN
     1640          FRAME v-suppl:SCROLLABLE       = FALSE
     1641          FRAME v-suppl:HIDDEN           = TRUE.
     1642   ASSIGN
     1643          loc-art:HIDDEN IN FRAME v-suppl           = TRUE.
     1644   ASSIGN
     1645          loc-code:HIDDEN IN FRAME v-suppl           = TRUE.
